Package: rcapsule
Title: Reproducibility Capsules and Multi-Target Containerization for R
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Marcus", "Harris", , "marcus.harris.uconn@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Compiles R analysis projects, Quarto manuscripts, R Markdown
    reports, R packages, and Shiny applications into lean, layer-cached
    Dockerfiles, multi-service 'docker-compose.yml' stacks, and HPC-ready
    Apptainer definitions. Resolves full-stack R package, OS system library,
    and scientific toolchain dependencies ('CmdStan', 'TMB'/'RTMB', 'JAGS',
    'C++', 'Rust', 'Python'/'reticulate', 'Quarto', and 'LaTeX'), records
    cryptographically verifiable provenance manifests ('capsule.json') with
    SHA-256 artifact hashes and optional HMAC-SHA256 signatures, and executes
    isolated reproducibility audits with exact and numeric-tolerance
    comparators to produce journal-ready verification certificates.
